# Artwork working set. The posters already committed under assets/ stay tracked —
# .gitignore only applies to untracked paths — so this keeps local artwork
# (assets/placeholders/ and anything else dropped in) out of the repo.
# Use `git add -f` to deliberately commit a new asset.
assets/
